## Real‑world examples

| Style | Layer ID | `icon-image` (raw) | `text-field` | `icon-text-fit` | Result |
|-------|----------|-------------------|--------------|----------------|--------|
| **OSM‑Bright** | `highway-shield-us-interstate` | `"{network}_{ref_length}"` | `"{ref}"` | *none* (pre‑drawn) | **Shield** |
| **OSM‑Bright** | `highway-shield-us-interstate-stretch` | `"us-interstate"` (single image) | `"{ref}"` | `"both"` (stretchable) | **Shield** |
| **OSM‑Bright** | `poi-label` | *none* (text only) | `"{name}"` | *none* | **Not a shield** |
| **OSM‑Bright** | `cafe` | `"cafe"` | *none* | *none* | **Not a shield** |
| **Custom style** | `my-place-names` | `"place"` | `"{name}"` | *none* | **Not a shield** |
| **Custom style** | `my-shields` | `["concat", ["get","network"], "_", ["get","ref_length"]]` | `"{ref}"` | *none* | **Shield** |

Notice how the **presence of `{ref}` in `text-field`** and a **placeholder in `icon-image`** is the decisive factor.

